  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;NACEUR JABNOUN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Naceur Jabnoun is a Tunisian academic with an insatiable thirst for knowledge, pursuing his thesis at the University of Geneva and later attending the University of Minnesota."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF GENEVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Geneva is an academic hub where Naceur Jabnoun meets his thesis advisor and feels a sense of pride as part of an esteemed institution."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Professor Dupont is a renowned expert in international relations who encourages Naceur Jabnoun and supports his research on the impact of globalization on North African economies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENEVA'S OLD TOWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Geneva's old town is where Naceur Jabnoun walks and feels the misty morning air, surrounded by the history and beauty of the city."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CATHEDRAL OF SAINT PETER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Cathedral of Saint Peter's bell tower echoes through the narrow alleys of Geneva's old town, reminding Naceur of the city's rich history."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNI BASTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Uni Bastions is the iconic campus of the University of Geneva where Naceur Jabnoun meets his thesis advisor."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RHÔNE RIVER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Rhône River is visible from Professor Dupont's office, symbolizing the flow of ideas and the connection between the university and the outside world."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF MINNESOTA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Minnesota is a public research university where Naceur Jabnoun pursued his academic career, known for its academic excellence and interdisciplinary research."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Minnesota is the institution where Naceur shared his experiences, known for its vibrant campus life and opportunities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TWIN CITIES OF MINNEAPOLIS AND SAINT PAUL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Twin Cities of Minneapolis and Saint Paul, Minnesota, United States, is the location of the University of Minnesota, known for its vibrant campus life and opportunities for academic growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON MANAGEMENT AND TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The International Conference on Management and Technology in 1998 featured Naceur Jabnoun as a presenter, showcasing his expertise in organizational behavior and leadership."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. AHMED BEN SALAH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Ahmed Ben Salah is a fellow Tunisian academic who collaborated with Naceur Jabnoun and recalls his experiences at the University of Minnesota."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENEVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Geneva is the city where Naceur Jabnoun walks and feels the misty morning air, surrounded by the history and beauty of the city."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OLIVE GROVES OF TUNIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The olive groves of Tunis are where Naceur Jabnoun's love affair with learning began, symbolizing his roots and early academic interests."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TUNIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tunis is Naceur Jabnoun's hometown, where his love affair with learning began and where he grew up."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINNEAPOLIS AND SAINT PAUL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Minneapolis and Saint Paul are the cities where the University of Minnesota is located, known for their vibrant campus life and opportunities for academic growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"International relations is the field of study that Professor Dupont specializes in, guiding Naceur Jabnoun's research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GLOBALIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Globalization is the topic of Naceur Jabnoun's research, exploring its impact on North African economies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORTH AFRICAN ECONOMIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"North African economies are the focus of Naceur Jabnoun's research, examining how globalization affects them."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORGANIZATIONAL BEHAVIOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Organizational behavior is the field of study that Naceur Jabnoun presents on at the International Conference on Management and Technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEADERSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Leadership is another aspect of Naceur Jabnoun's research, explored in his presentation at the International Conference on Management and Technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The academic community is the network of scholars and researchers that Naceur Jabnoun engages with at both the University of Geneva and the University of Minnesota."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTELLECTUAL CURIOSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Intellectual curiosity is the driving force behind Naceur Jabnoun's academic journey, pushing him to explore new frontiers in research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The research community is the group of scholars and researchers that Naceur Jabnoun interacts with, contributing to the advancement of knowledge."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF MINNESOTA ARCHIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Minnesota archives contain records of Naceur Jabnoun's participation in academic conferences and seminars."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC EXCELLENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Academic excellence is a hallmark of the University of Minnesota, attracting talented scholars from around the world."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERDISCIPLINARY RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Interdisciplinary research is a focus of the University of Minnesota, fostering a culture of intellectual curiosity and innovation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VIBRANT CAMPUS LIFE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vibrant campus life is a characteristic of the University of Minnesota, offering a rich academic and social environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOUNDING FAMILIES OF GENEVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Founding families of Geneva are represented in the coats of arms adorning the University of Geneva's stone façade."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COATS OF ARMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coats of arms are decorative elements on the University of Geneva's stone façade, symbolizing the city's heritage and history."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUDIES OF INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Studies of international relations are a key area of focus for Naceur Jabnoun, guiding his academic pursuits."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH PROJECTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research projects are a significant part of Naceur Jabnoun's academic work, involving collaborative efforts and presentations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THICK, ROUND GLASSES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thick, round glasses are worn by Professor Dupont, symbolizing his scholarly demeanor and expertise."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THOROUGH EXAMINATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A thorough examination of Naceur Jabnoun's curriculum vitae reveals his academic journey and achievements."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CURRICULUM VITAE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Curriculum vitae is a document that lists Naceur Jabnoun's educational and professional background, highlighting his academic journey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AHMED BEN SALAH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ahmed Ben Salah is a Tunisian academic who collaborated with Jabnoun on multiple projects and recalls Naceur's experiences at the University of Minnesota."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0498</data>
